# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Large input datasets.
#
# These are published elsewhere and must not be committed. The Azure
# vmtable alone is ~0.76 GB, well past GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit,
# and CarbonCast is redistributable but large. Both are fetched by the
# instructions in the README instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
data/AzureVMTraces/
data/carboncast/
*.csv.gz
*.zip

# Generated traces. Reproducible from prep_traces.py plus the sources
# above, and regenerated in place by every run.
data/carbon_intensity.csv
data/vm_requests.csv
data/trace_meta.properties

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Results.
#
# Keep results/ under version control -- the figures and tables in the
# paper are derived from it and it is small -- but exclude the scratch
# file that each run overwrites.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
results/results.csv

